---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Refunds — DiskPrune">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Refunds</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 mb-4">
      DiskPrune is a $19 one-time license. If it is not useful on your Mac, email
      <a href="mailto:support@diskprune.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">support@diskprune.com</a>
      within 14 days of purchase and we will refund the Stripe charge.
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 mb-4">
      After a refund the license is revoked. Further activations are refused. Already-issued
      tokens expire on their own (up to 90 days); do not keep using the product after a refund.
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-300">
      Chargebacks without contacting us first may revoke the license immediately.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
